angzarr is licensed per crate. There is no single licence for this repository.

Each crate directory holds the licence files of its group (LICENSE-AGPL,
LICENSE-EXCEPTION, LICENSE-APACHE, LICENSE-BSD), and the table in README.md
says which crate is in which group. The texts are at the root:

  LICENSE-AGPL             GNU Affero General Public License, version 3
  LICENSE-EXCEPTION        the runtime exception, for crates of group B
  LICENSE-GRPC-PERMISSION  the AGPL section 7 permission for programs that only
                           use the published gRPC API
  LICENSE-APACHE           Apache License 2.0
  LICENSE-BSD              BSD 3-Clause License

Files outside crates/ are Apache-2.0 OR BSD-3-Clause unless a file says otherwise.
